### ============================================================================
### XML REQUEST EXAMPLES - Correlation Tracking Support (WCF Compatible)
### ============================================================================
### NOTE: All XML examples use proper WCF DataContract namespace
###       Element names must match DataMember properties (PascalCase)
###       camelCase XML will NOT work with WCF DataContractSerializer
### ============================================================================

### 17. XML Request - Root Level Correlation IDs
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Appointment xmlns="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/RedactionWcf.Models">
  <AppointmentDate>2024-12-24T10:00:00</AppointmentDate>
  <CorrelationId>xml-root-001</CorrelationId>
  <ConsumerId>xml-consumer-app</ConsumerId>
  <Description>Testing XML with root level correlation IDs</Description>
  <DoctorName>Dr. XML</DoctorName>
  <DurationMinutes>30</DurationMinutes>
  <Location>Room 601</Location>
  <PatientName>XML Test Patient</PatientName>
  <Title>XML Root Level Test</Title>
  <UserId>xml-user@example.com</UserId>
</Appointment>

###

### 18. XML Request - Nested Header Element
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Appointment xmlns="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/RedactionWcf.Models">
  <Header xmlns="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/">
    <CorrelationId>xml-nested-001</CorrelationId>
    <ConsumerId>xml-nested-consumer</ConsumerId>
    <UserId>xml-nested-user@example.com</UserId>
  </Header>
  <AppointmentDate>2024-12-24T14:00:00</AppointmentDate>
  <Description>Testing XML with nested Header element</Description>
  <DoctorName>Dr. Nested</DoctorName>
  <DurationMinutes>45</DurationMinutes>
  <Location>Room 602</Location>
  <PatientName>Nested XML Patient</PatientName>
  <Title>XML Nested Header Test</Title>
</Appointment>

###

